  "Length limit raised from 2048 to 4096 tokens for training (SFT max_length, OPD vLLM max_model_len) and generation: train rank 1543 has a 2307-token prompt and the longest test prompt has 1968 tokens. No output changes for prompts that fit in 2048.",
